exports[`合并 / 不合 after both conflicting clauses > snapshot: the thread with the chips 1`] = `"<div class="ask"><div class="wthread"><div class="wm me"><div class="bub">v17 过一遍。</div></div><div class="wm them"><img class="av" src="/kuro/k3d_base.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true"><div><div class="bub"><p>Good to see you.</p><p>这个怎么做？</p></div></div></div><div class="wm me"><div class="bub">自己做</div></div><div class="wm them"><img class="av" src="/kuro/k3d_base.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true"><div><div class="bub">第 6 条和第 11 条打架了。要我合一下吗？</div><div class="wchips"><button type="button" class="chip" data-action="wb-merge" data-merge="1">合并</button><button type="button" class="chip" data-action="wb-merge" data-merge="0">不合</button></div></div></div><div class="surface doc"><div class="cols"><div class="col"><button type="button" class="cl" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="0" aria-pressed="false">一、合作期限：自签署之日起十二个月。</button><button type="button" class="cl y" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="1" aria-pressed="false">二、甲方应于每月十日前支付上月服务费。</button><button type="button" class="cl" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="2" aria-pressed="false">三、乙方按月提交服务报告，甲方五个工作日内确认。</button><button type="button" class="cl y" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="3" aria-pressed="false">四、甲方逾期付款的，每日按应付金额千分之一计付违约金。</button><button type="button" class="cl" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="4" aria-pressed="false">五、乙方交付物的知识产权归甲方所有。</button><button type="button" class="cl on" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="5" aria-pressed="true">六、乙方有权在甲方逾期付款超过三十日时暂停服务。</button><button type="button" class="cl" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="6" aria-pressed="false">七、双方对本协议内容负有保密义务。</button><button type="button" class="cl y" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="7" aria-pressed="false">八、任一方提前终止须提前三十日书面通知。</button><button type="button" class="cl" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="8" aria-pressed="false">九、本协议适用中华人民共和国法律。</button><button type="button" class="cl" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="9" aria-pressed="false">十、争议由甲方所在地法院管辖。</button><button type="button" class="cl on" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="10" aria-pressed="true">十一、乙方在任何情况下不得暂停服务。</button><button type="button" class="cl" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="11" aria-pressed="false">十二、本协议一式两份，双方各执一份。</button></div><div class="col"><button type="button" class="cl" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="0" aria-pressed="false">一、合作期限：自签署之日起十二个月。</button><button type="button" class="cl y" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="1" aria-pressed="false">二、甲方应于每月十五日前支付上月服务费。</button><button type="button" class="cl" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="2" aria-pressed="false">三、乙方按月提交服务报告，甲方五个工作日内确认。</button><button type="button" class="cl y" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="3" aria-pressed="false">四、甲方逾期付款的，每日按应付金额万分之五计付违约金。</button><button type="button" class="cl" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="4" aria-pressed="false">五、乙方交付物的知识产权归甲方所有。</button><button type="button" class="cl on" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="5" aria-pressed="true">六、乙方有权在甲方逾期付款超过三十日时暂停服务。</button><button type="button" class="cl" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="6" aria-pressed="false">七、双方对本协议内容负有保密义务。</button><button type="button" class="cl y" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="7" aria-pressed="false">八、任一方提前终止须提前十五日书面通知。</button><button type="button" class="cl" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="8" aria-pressed="false">九、本协议适用中华人民共和国法律。</button><button type="button" class="cl" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="9" aria-pressed="false">十、争议由甲方所在地法院管辖。</button><button type="button" class="cl on" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="10" aria-pressed="true">十一、乙方在任何情况下不得暂停服务。</button><button type="button" class="cl" data-action="wb-clause" data-i="11" aria-pressed="false">十二、本协议一式两份，双方各执一份。</button></div></div></div></div><input class="ph" data-input="wb-draft" data-enter="wb-send" readonly value="" placeholder="说一句，比如：把 v16 和 v17 合一版" aria-label="说一句，比如：把 v16 和 v17 合一版"><div class="strip"><button type="button" class="scope" data-action="wb-scope" aria-pressed="false">只看本公司文档</button><button type="button" class="go